# Token of the "E2E Data Seeder" Analysis (Run on: External, no script). Copy it from the
# Analysis page in Admin.
# Used by the Freezer Dashboard tests to send a known sensor reading (temperature, door,
# compressor) to the sensor the test just created, so the dashboard and Cold Rooms cards
# show values the test can check.
# Permissions, from the Access Management policy "[Analysis] - E2E Data Seeder sensor data":
# only Device / Send data, on devices tagged device_type=device (the sensors). It can't read,
# edit or delete data, list devices, or touch any other resource.
E2E_TAGOIO_ANALYSIS_TOKEN=
